  <item>
    <title>109.这个夏天，有人偶遇旧爱，有人爱上新人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a63a055a3fec224d5a2e988</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a63a055a3fec224d5a2e988</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这个暑假竹子回到北京，面对韩夏闲聊了过去一个月发生的生活事件，比如说偶遇王嘉尔。两人就最近的热剧《校园之外》发表了一些想法。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间码:</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 竹子回京感受：北京朋友比较“湿”，上海朋友比较“干”。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 那一晚，竹子得到了和王嘉尔的人生合照。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a> 追世界杯的韩夏，有了新欢！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 还有谁没看过Off Campus啊？我们力荐的理由是...</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3554">59:14</a> 竹子越野跑完赛，爱上跑山就如呼吸一样自然。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4149">01:09:09</a> 韩夏：我可能会参加HYROX到老。</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><strong><span>本期BGM:</span></strong></p><p><span>Baby Now That I've Found You-The Foundations</span></p><p><strong><span>本期提及：</span></strong></p><p><span>《Off Campus》</span></p><p><span>《Normal People》</span><br></p>]]></description>
