  <item>
    <title>097.防止变笨的邪修大法，我这样对抗算法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6961e9f1e235ea65bc13991e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6961e9f1e235ea65bc13991e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 06:03:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如何不被算法喂养，建立自己的信息库，是竹子和韩夏感到很困扰的问题。这一期里竹子和韩夏分享了在信息过载的现在，令她们困扰的行为，以及如何对抗这种纷扰的邪修方法。</span></p><span></span><h4><span>时间码:</span></h4><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 是我们真的变笨了？还是过于追求效率？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 如何不被算法喂养？养小号吧，艺术小竹来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 信息的断舍离：从主动筛选信息开始。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 专业“小号”养成指南：列出你最感兴趣的三件事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1859">30:59</a> 竹子：面对庞杂的信息，你也会感到焦虑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 韩夏：出租车上和手机短暂分离，是我最享受的精神漫游时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> 工作日下午两点，谁不想消失俩小时看电影啊？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3194">53:14</a> 竹子：我几乎每天都在约人...见面！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3394">56:34</a> 面对面，人和人。屏幕消失，故事才会发生。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3836">01:03:56</a> 我们的老派但好用的招儿！订阅周刊&amp;浏览网站</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期BGM:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Elenore - Sultan+Shepard/Andrew Belle</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目提到的书籍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《明亮的夜晚》《对我无害之人》《即使以最微弱的光》 崔恩荣</span></p><span></span><p><span>《赞美闲散》 伯特兰.罗素</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提及的创意网站：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>DIRECTORS’ LIBRARY&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Directors Notes &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vimeo &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提及的音乐网站：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Pitchfork &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>SoundCloud&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提及的新闻网站：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>The Guardian、The Economist 《经济学人》、Financial Times、财新</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/605b0d5d64b27cf2f137f131/luTWsdDmd2WOaj6-PixtpylpWkyi.m4a" length="80669263" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FktaO8NkT3SQwuTdM1UE3D1QzCAC.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>97</itunes:episode>
