  <item>
    <title>096.你别笑了，说出这些口头禅的我羞耻极了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69459dc29f70e5d6b34383b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69459dc29f70e5d6b34383b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Dec 2025 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>竹子刷到了一个00后/10后的口头禅视频，瞬间泛起一波回忆杀，约着韩夏一起聊一聊，那些年来，我们说过的口头禅都有哪些。</span></p><span></span><h4><span>时间码:</span></h4><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> &nbsp;这些年代竟然流行说这个？速来认领代表你的年代口头禅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> &nbsp;逐帧学习00后最常说的十个口头禅，这题我真不会啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> &nbsp;10后的口头禅是... 算了，不如放弃学习。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> &nbsp;80后&amp;90后的这些口头禅，你听过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> &nbsp;韩夏最爱的口头禅，论“哇噻”的不同使用场景指南。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> &nbsp;竹子：曾经在北京中小学圈风靡的口头禅，是我发明的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2456">40:56</a> &nbsp;QQ回忆杀：你是GG还是MM？你是恐龙还是青蛙？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> &nbsp;爆笑预警：崔壳，别假装我妈了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3619">01:00:19</a> &nbsp;韩夏：我倒，就地分手！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3957">01:05:57</a> &nbsp;大学的时候又流行些什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期BGM:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Merry Go- Kevin MacLeod</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/605b0d5d64b27cf2f137f131/lnis4krkc0r4TloBK89RJ1n8k0V2.m4a" length="78487017" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPDplxjrQNGVrkzRx-E7xSqkWbU.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>96</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>095.我这岁数了，不求白幼瘦，但求肌肉！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6932d65b3fec3166cf76c586</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6932d65b3fec3166cf76c586</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Dec 2025 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前段时间韩夏神秘兮兮地给竹子发短信，几乎“勒令”似的要求她看一档综艺节目《体能之巅》。结果竹子从第三季亚洲大挑战垂直入坑，看得夜不能寐，肾上腺素狂飙。时不时激动地给韩夏发短信，什么时候我们去练柔术？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一集从《体能之巅》开始，逐渐延伸到健身运动体育精神的闲聊节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不想被剧透的朋友，可以从34分钟跳转开始听。</span></p><span></span><h4><span>时间码:</span></h4><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 《体能之巅》到底是一档什么节目？为何让人痴迷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> &nbsp;让她们印象最深的情节是...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a> &nbsp;最想嫁和耕的选手分别是...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> &nbsp;最想成为的女选手是...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2047">34:07</a> &nbsp;为什么爱看竞技类综艺节目？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2309">38:29</a> &nbsp;竹子：我是那个扔铅球永远扔不过及格线的小鸡子。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2574">42:54</a> &nbsp;韩夏：“挫败感”是体育曾经留给我的唯一感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2863">47:43</a> &nbsp;我们喜欢体育什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3265">54:25</a> &nbsp;韩夏：突破自己的极限，不放弃的勇气，我才得到！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3566">59:26</a> &nbsp;竹子：你的丈夫/朋友/同事都会辜负你，但体育不会！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3998">01:06:38</a> &nbsp;谁是我们身边对自己最狠&amp;最有毅力的人？没想到竟然是他。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4712">01:18:32</a> &nbsp;如何培养我们的意志力？这里有一些tips</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期BGM:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>回到你身边 - 杭盖乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>Un'estate italiana - Gianna Nannini</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期视频推荐的综艺节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《体能之巅》</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</sp